@MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### Rooms (seeded: Vienas, Du, Trys, and inactive Keturi)
GET {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Include inactive rooms
GET {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rooms?includeInactive=true
Accept: application/json

### Users
GET {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/views
Accept: application/json

### Reservations
GET {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Accept: application/json

### Create a reservation (R1-R7 are enforced here)
POST {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Sprint planning",
  "startDate": "2026-10-28T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-28T11:00:00Z",
  "attendeeCount": 5
}

### Update a reservation
PUT {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Sprint planning (moved)",
  "startDate": "2026-10-29T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-29T11:00:00Z",
  "attendeeCount": 5
}

### Cancel a reservation
DELETE {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/1

### End the seeded ongoing reservation early (id 5 on a fresh database)
POST {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/5/complete
Accept: application/json
